WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.605 --> 00:00:02.625
Mulder: "You said a man's behind this"

00:00:03.665 --> 00:00:05.275
Mulder: "It's only half the story."

00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:09.255
Mulder: "He wants to exterminate humanity."

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:10.800
"Leave it alone, Mulder."

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.500
Mulder: "What does he want with my son?"

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:16.820
"Nothing hurts like the truth." [Laughter, cackles]

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.620
[Breathes] ... [Beep as button pressed] ... [Buzzer sounds]

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:31.660
Scully: "I've seen how it begins."

00:00:33.955 --> 00:00:37.445
Scully: "We need your help, even if we don't trust you."

00:00:51.315 --> 00:00:52.315
Scully: "Mulder..."

00:00:52.825 --> 00:00:53.825
Scully: "I've seen how..."

00:00:54.755 --> 00:00:56.155
Scully: "I've seen how it begins."

00:01:03.925 --> 00:01:05.505
CSM: "I'm here to offer you a deal."

00:01:07.745 --> 00:01:10.675
CSM: "Civilisation is in its final stages."

00:01:13.885 --> 00:01:16.865
CSM: "I'm asking you to betray the whole human race."

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:20.565
"Do you mind if I smoke?"

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:26.880
"Kill him, before he kills us all."

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:37.120
"We want to save humanity."

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:40.980
Mulder: "You want to see blood on the streets. The extermination of seven billion people"

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:45.500
Scully: "I have to find our son."

00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:47.835
Langley: "Mulder! They know that we know!"

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:52.240
Scully: "We need your help."

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:54.060
Scully: "Even if we don't trust you."

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:56.060
Skinner: "How did we get here?"

00:01:57.580 --> 00:01:58.920
"He needs the boy, Mr Mulder."

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:00.960
Mulder: "My son is none of your business."

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:02.900
"He's a very special child."

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:03.900
Scully: "William"

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.340
Scully: "Aah!" (as if in pain)

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:08.340
Scully: "You have to find him...

00:02:09.355 --> 00:02:10.585
... and you have to stop him...

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:12.900
... before he unleashes hell on earth."

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.100
Scully: "The truth still lies in the X-Files, Mulder."

